        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A rare opportunity in a highly popular Dublin 7 developement.This owner occupied, own door apartment enjoys an enviable position within a peaceful, secure and much sought after gated mixed residential enclave just off Manor Street, in the heart of Stoneybatter village, with an array of independent outlets, destination cafes and bars on on offer.  Close to all amenities and within walking distance of the Phoenix Park, Heuston Station, Luas (Museum Stop), TU Dublin campus at Grangegorman and indeed the City Centre itself.  The property offers bright and modern living space and briefly comprises entrance hall, large living/dining room, separate kitchen, double bedroom, bathroom and private sunny patio to rear. The property benefits from many extras including 1 secure parking space, gas fired central heating, Rationale double glazed windows and exterior doors, electronic security gates and northwest facing private patio garden to the rear. Viewing is highly recommended by appointment only through our Manor Street Office.\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\r\n\r\nHallway 5m (16'5\") x 1.15m (3'9\")\r\nWelcoming hallway with storage, laminate wood flooring leading to the main living room.\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining 5.47m (17'11\") x 4.79m (15'9\")\r\nGreat living space with room to relax and dine, wood flooring, inset fire with wood surround, access to the rear patio through Rational French doors.\r\n\r\nKitchen 3.33m (10'11\") x 1.81m (5'11\")\r\nOff the main living room a separate kitchen with both eye & floor level units, shelving, built in appliances, plumbed for laundry.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3.1m (10'2\") x 3.57m (11'9\")\r\nA spacious double bedroom to the front of the property with built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom 2.4m (7'10\") x 1.7m (5'7\")\r\nFull bathroom with bath/shower combination, WHB & WC.\r\n\r\nExterior \r\nParking for one car to the front, patio to the rear opening on to a communal green space.\r\n\r\nArea \r\nApprox. 50 Sq Mts / 538 Sq Ft\r\n\r\nOffers \r\n\r\nPlease email your offer with proof of funds/ mortgage approval from a banking institute (Letter from a mortgage broker is not acceptable) to offers@propertyshopmanorst.ie"
      },
      {
